{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Do not let your heads hang loose.</b> Even though the deceased were among the close relatives for whom an ordinary priest contracts impurity, He was stringent upon these because they were anointed, as it says: כִּי שֶׁמֶן מִשְׁחַת ה׳ עֲלֵיכֶם (Leviticus 10:7)." "<b>Let all the house of Israel bewail.</b> For they lacked two righteous and great men, and accordingly the glory of the deceased shall not be diminished."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:59.901887040Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}